
TY  - JOUR
T1  - A Modern Approach towards an Industry 4.0 Model: From Driving Technologies to Management
AU  - Tsaramirsis, Georgios
AU  - Kantaros, Antreas
AU  - Al-Darraji, Izzat
AU  - Piromalis, Dimitrios
AU  - Apostolopoulos, Charalampos
AU  - Pavlopoulou, Athanasia
AU  - Alrammal, Muath
AU  - Ismail, Zamhar
AU  - Buhari, Seyed M.
AU  - Stojmenovic, Milos
