N2  - Summary This chapter introduces the concept of thin films and coatings and then emphasized the importance and wide applications of thin films and coatings for academic study and industrial applications. The recent progress in the main and important types of thin films and coatings are summarized and discussed according to their significance for our society's development using some typical examples, particularly those for the innovation of information technology, of ultrasensitive sensing devices, of sustainable energy technology, of key sources and ecological environment of the Earth, of biomedical engineering and life science, and of national defense and homeland security.
